  id: q1
  title: Brawler
  description: The brawler, who returned from a long voyage with his henchmen, has
    not left the <b>Tavern</b> for three days. He constantly fights, breaks dishes,
    and harasses the girls. The locals are looking for someone who can drive him
    away and are willing to pay for it with coin.
  descriptionCompleted: <b>One-eyed Rupert</b> and his cronies got a good thrashing
    and won't be showing up here again. The locals are very grateful to you for that.
